<title>UK: CLF Hypo sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>CLF Hypo sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CLF HYPOTHEKENBANK BERLIN</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.75     MATURITY   *28.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE    STEP-UP	ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE  S-22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS	ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO APRIL 1998, THEN 4.25 PCT IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 490</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
